                <section class="main col-md-9">
                    <article>
                        <h2>About</h2>
                        <p>
                            I AM RAJ MAHARJAN. just an ordinary office worker—or
                            so I thought. My life was mundane, predictable, and
                            filled with the pages of Three Ways to Survive in a
                            Ruined World, the web novel I had been the sole
                            reader of for over a decade.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            But when the world suddenly transformed into the
                            very apocalypse described in that novel, I realized
                            that my knowledge was my only advantage. Unlike
                            everyone else, I knew what would happen next. I knew
                            the fates of the strongest characters, the hidden
                            scenarios, and the tragedies to come.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Armed with nothing but my understanding of the story
                            and my determination to survive, I set out to defy
                            fate. I am not the protagonist. I am not the
                            strongest. But I am Kim Dokja—the only reader who
                            knows the end of this world.
                        </p>
                        <p>And I will change it.</p>
                        <p>Omniscient Readers Viewpoint</p>
                    </article>
                </section>
            </div>
        </div>

      
